## CI/CD Integration

### Required Pre-Deployment Check

Add to `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`:

```yaml
- name: Security scan (ast-grep)
  run: sg scan --error  # Fail CI on security issues
```

### Pre-Commit Hook

```bash
#!/bin/sh
# .git/hooks/pre-commit
sg scan --filter "no-parsefloat-stake" --error
sg scan --filter "d1-sql-injection" --error
```

---

## Production Checklist

Before deploying to production:

- [ ] Run `sg scan --error` locally
- [ ] All critical rules pass (no-parsefloat-stake, d1-sql-injection)
- [ ] Input validation uses `Number()` not `parseFloat()`
- [ ] All D1 queries use `.bind()` parameterization
- [ ] Queue sends respect 100-message batch limit
- [ ] No `new Date()` without arguments in workers
- [ ] WASM memory freed in finally{} blocks

